  {"id":54,"x":380,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["Murky slime burbles below, seeming to grow deeper and thicker the more one stands still.  Wild foliage climbs in every direction, the wicked and unintended children of the Zaulfung's inadvertent nourishment."],"exits":[{"to":53,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":63,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"},{"to":55,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":55,"x":360,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["A single branch has splintered off a nearby tree, now slowly sinking into the murky quagmire below.  It reaches up like a wretched claw, grasping for what futile semblance of life it had attained in this foul garden."],"exits":[{"to":56,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"},{"to":54,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":57,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":56,"x":380,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["The brush grows denser here, thick tangles of foliage rising right out of the muddy waters, flourishing despite the deathly fumes that coil and swath over every semblance of the living, threatening to wring life's breath from every last pore."],"exits":[{"to":46,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":55,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":57,"x":340,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["A massive stone structure stretches to the north and south here, half-sunken into the swamp itself.  Irregular patterns of brambles twist and grapple over its surface, looking a great deal like thousands of scraggly clawed hands attempting to drag the grotto beneath the muddy sludge to devour it whole."],"exits":[{"to":36,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":55,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":58,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":58,"x":340,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["The eastern wall of brambles curves sharply to the south, widening the swampy path to make it passable around the front leg of the stone structure that blocks the direct southern route.  The carving is detailed even on this back side of the leg, its elbow jabbed deep down into the murky waters."],"exits":[{"to":57,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":59,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":59,"x":360,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["The massive arm of the stone jackal monument rises from the northern mire, stretching far out to the southwest.  Following the line of sight with the paw, a massive bird-like head is visible, looming above the brackish mist like some sort of twisted guardian."],"exits":[{"to":60,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"},{"to":58,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":60,"x":340,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["A dense layer of brackish green fog is buoyed upon the air, constantly stagnating at eye-level.  The noxious stench emanating from the gasses is nearly too much to bear, and pockets of fresh air are slim and infrequent.  Stretching from the northeast to the southwest, a large stone structure serves as a landmark to this uncharted path, beckoning loiterers onward."],"exits":[{"to":59,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"},{"to":61,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"},{"to":77,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":61,"x":340,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["Brackish water lurks roughly knee-high on a Human throughout this swamp, making it quite laborious to trudge through the slime.  It is unknown what lurks beneath its depths due to the sickly greenish-brown color the mud has taken on."],"exits":[{"to":60,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":62,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":62,"x":360,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["A disgusting slurping noise constantly plagues your ears as bubbles rise to the surface of the swamp only to burst and release their noxious fumes into the air.  The looming foliage seems to draw in closer, the canopy above growing more confining as the gasses begin to take their toll."],"exits":[{"to":63,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":69,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"},{"to":61,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":63,"x":380,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["Thick, tangled brush flourishes over this murky swamp, obscured by a lazy black mist that constantly rolls up from the sludge underfoot.  The sickly gas tendrils writhe through the air, incorporating themselves with the sky above like a thick shawl of shadow."],"exits":[{"to":54,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":51,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":64,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":62,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":64,"x":400,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["A large, clawed footprint has been preserved in a raised portion of the mud here, a foreboding sign to travelers who dare disturb the eerie sense of peace that pervades this sickly wilderness."],"exits":[{"to":65,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":70,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"},{"to":63,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":65,"x":420,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["A choking pall of putrid vapor drifts through the swamp, held prisoner by the canopy of tormented foliage above.  The gas weaves a monstrous miasma of death and destruction, one that no living creature should be subjected to.  It is a ghastly wonder what morbid fate could have created a place as horrid as this."],"exits":[{"to":51,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":66,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":64,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":66,"x":460,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["The brush grows denser here, thick tangles of foliage rising right out of the muddy waters, flourishing despite the deathly fumes that coil and swath every semblance of the living, threatening to wring the life from every last pore."],"exits":[{"to":67,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"},{"to":65,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":67,"x":420,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["Thick tangles of thorny brambles cover what little land is elevated enough not to be drowned by the brackish mud, blocking the path on the easiest of routes and making it necessary to trudge through the muck and mire."],"exits":[{"to":66,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"},{"to":68,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":68,"x":380,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["Thick reeds jut upward from the murky waters, forming a small burrow for the harmless creatures of the region.  The omnipresent canopy surrounding most of the swamp breaks here, allowing the fumes to drift upward into the sky, escaping the festering quagmire."],"exits":[{"to":70,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":67,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":69,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":69,"x":360,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["The miasma grows thicker, the noxious stench becoming almost too much to bear.  Each step is laborious and fatiguing, the knee-high muddy water making movement much slower than on dry land."],"exits":[{"to":62,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":68,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":71,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":70,"x":380,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["A single branch has splintered off a nearby tree, now slowly sinking into the murky quagmire below.  It reaches up like a wretched claw, grasping for what futile semblance of life it had attained in this foul garden."],"exits":[{"to":64,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":68,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":71,"x":320,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["Putrid fumes rising from the swamp coalesce into a heavy blanket of black fog that flows all through the surrounding air, held in by the ceiling of twisted branches and vines above."],"exits":[{"to":69,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"},{"to":72,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":77,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":72,"x":340,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["Withered and sickly-looking creeper vines dangle from the canopy of claw-like branches above, resembling lifeless snakes that have met the somber touch of Eylhaar, asphyxiated by the noxious fumes burbling from the murky waters below."],"exits":[{"to":73,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"},{"to":71,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":73,"x":340,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["A looming blanket of black fog drifts lazily through the surrounding air, obscuring the sky and incubating the swamp's noxious gasses in the cramped space beneath the canopy of twisted trees above."],"exits":[{"to":72,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":74,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":74,"x":300,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["A large, clawed footprint has been preserved in a raised portion of the mud here, a foreboding sign to travelers who dare disturb the eerie sense of peace that pervades this sickly wilderness."],"exits":[{"to":73,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":75,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":75,"x":280,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["A disgusting slurping noise constantly plagues your ears as bubbles rise to the surface of the swamp only to burst and release their noxious fumes into the air.  The looming foliage seems to draw in closer, the canopy above growing more confining as the gasses begin to take their toll."],"exits":[{"to":76,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":74,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":94,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":76,"x":280,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Aldauth's Maw","descriptions":["A massive structure looms out of the mists at the north edge of the clearing, the only semblance of civilization amidst this wasteland of gaseous swamp.  Stylized and almost primitive, it appears to be a statue consisting of portions of three different animals that concoct a chimaera of great age and mystery.  Directly above, a giant stone vulture's head protrudes from a body much resembling a jackal's, with paws outstretched to either side."],"exits":[{"to":77,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":75,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"},{"to":98,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"},{"to":78,"exit":"climb","move":"climb vulture beak"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":77,"x":300,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["A giant paw sculpture of carved stone lies half-sunken into the marsh, still standing the height of two Gnomes.  Carefully-detailed claws clutch the muddy earth, as if afraid to let loose their grip and allow the entire structure to be devoured by the swamp."],"exits":[{"to":60,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":71,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":76,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":78,"x":280,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Kweld Gelvdael, Vulture's Maw","descriptions":["Grotesque depictions of horrific beasts are etched over the dark stone walls like cobwebs, each unique and intricate in its own right.  The entrance to this dark grotto gapes open, carved by the hands of the ancients to pay homage to Aldauth's vulture.  Beyond the edge of the massive beak structure you perch upon, the rancid swamp stretches out below."],"exits":[{"to":79,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":76,"exit":"none","move":"jump swamp"}],"color":"#A6A3D9","aliases":["Shrine2-04","Aldauth","Vulture's Maw","Tongue"]},
  {"id":79,"x":280,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Kweld Gelvdael, Vulture's Gullet","descriptions":["The dark stone walls have been carved with strange ridges, evoking the image of vertebrae and other bones protruding into the vulture's gullet."],"exits":[{"to":78,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":80,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":80,"x":280,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Kweld Gelvdael, Vulture's Gullet","descriptions":["This strange circular crawlspace offers little room to maneuver around.  The gullet yawns open into a larger cavern to the north, while carved steps in the stone floor to the west curve upward, further into the throat of this giant beast.  A rough black basalt slab is leaned up against the wall flanking the steps, covered in strange glyphs of a forgotten language."],"exits":[{"to":81,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":79,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":81,"x":280,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Kweld Gelvdael, Jackal's Belly","descriptions":["The grotto opens into a quaint, yet cold living space to the north.  The stone floor is smooth and polished, with not a speck of dust apparent to the naked eye.  It seems strange, given the state of the swamp, that this cavern would be so well looked after."],"exits":[{"to":85,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":84,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":80,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":82,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":82,"x":260,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Kweld Gelvdael, Jackal's Belly","descriptions":["The smooth stone of the cavern floor curves gently upward to create the western wall.  A deep niche in the wall has been hollowed out and filled with fertile soil, creating a flourishing garden filled with various herbs and small plants.  Off to the north, a dimly-lit tunnel winds into the floor, curving down into the depths of the grotto."],"exits":[{"to":83,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":85,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":81,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":86,"exit":"go","move":"go dark tunnel"}]},
  {"id":83,"x":280,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Kweld Gelvdael, Jackal's Belly","descriptions":["A jagged crevice has been rended open high up in the northern wall.  The climb looks treacherous, but several carved hand and foot holds make it less foreboding.  The stone is smooth and shines with a freshly-polished luster, so care must still be taken to keep from slipping."],"exits":[{"to":84,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":85,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":82,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":91,"exit":"climb","move":"climb jagged crevice"}]},
  {"id":84,"x":300,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Kweld Gelvdael, Jackal's Belly","descriptions":["A small niche yawns open in the eastern wall, its surface carved into the shape of a gaping jackal's maw.  Great attention to detail has been paid to the stone carving.  Despite its ancient appearance, it has been polished and taken care of with stringent devotion."],"exits":[{"to":81,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":85,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":83,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":85,"x":280,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Kweld Gelvdael, Jackal's Heart","descriptions":["The center of the cavern is dominated by a large pool filled with inky black water.  Its surface is smooth like a single pane of glass, and not a ripple disturbs the serene shrine.  A cylindrical obsidian altar flanks the entrance to the pool, a sign of reverence to the holy waters within."],"exits":[{"to":83,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":84,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":81,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":82,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":90,"exit":"go","move":"go black pool"}],"color":"#A6A3D9","aliases":["Eylhaar","Jackal's Heart"]},
  {"id":86,"x":260,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Kweld Gelvdael, Dark Tunnel","descriptions":["The smooth walls twist and curve, as if naturally hollowed out by erosion over time.  The tunnel is dim, yet the illumination of torchlight reveals it to be well looked after, and cleanly swept.  A wide opening in the southern wall leads back into the main cavern."],"exits":[{"to":87,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":82,"exit":"go","move":"go wide opening"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":87,"x":270,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Kweld Gelvdael, Dark Tunnel","descriptions":["The tunnel curves downward smoothly and naturally in a serpentine fashion, leading deeper into the ancient cavern.  Spidery etchings cover the eastern wall, depicting a strange scene of a scorpion, jackal, and vulture all convened around a glassy pool of water."],"exits":[{"to":86,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":88,"exit":"down","move":"down"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":88,"x":270,"y":230,"z":0,"title":"Kweld Gelvdael, Dark Tunnel","descriptions":["A roaring reed torch has been nestled into a bronze sconce in the stone wall, illuminating the serpentine hallway brightly.  Freshly-swept stone steps rise upward into the cavern above, yet the tunnel snakes on to the west."],"exits":[{"to":89,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":87,"exit":"up","move":"up"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":89,"x":260,"y":230,"z":0,"title":"Kweld Gelvdael, Dark Tunnel","descriptions":["The tunnel comes to an abrupt halt as the western floor rises slowly up into the ceiling.  A giant stone scorpion sculpture adorns the cul-de-sac, its stinger poised as if to strike out at anything that dares draw near it.  Shadows dance and flicker over its surface as a lit torch set in a bronze wall sconce shines brightly, lending to the unease of the scene of the readied creature."],"exits":[{"to":88,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":123,"exit":"go","move":"go amorphous spirits"}],"color":"#00FFFF"},
  {"id":90,"x":300,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Kweld Gelvdael, Jackal's Spirit","descriptions":["A sense of serenity saturates the aquatic shrine, as if guarded by an otherworldly presence.  The glassy black water is so frigid that it numbs your flesh immediately upon first contact, beckoning you to lie back and drift down into the deathly grasp of the jackal's spirit."],"exits":[{"to":85,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"aliases":["Jackal's Spirit"]},
  {"id":91,"x":280,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Kweld Gelvdael, Scorpion's Tail","descriptions":["A massive stone tail arcs upward, towering over the wretched marsh.  The canopy of the swamp stretches out infinitely below, a withered green carpet that holds the foulness below its deathly shroud."],"exits":[{"to":92,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":83,"exit":"climb","move":"climb jagged crevice"}]},
  {"id":92,"x":280,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Kweld Gelvdael, Scorpion's Tail","descriptions":["Smooth stone steps have been carved into the segmented tail, arcing upward into the sky.  One wrong move could prove devastating, sending you hurtling down through the blighted canopy into the waters below."],"exits":[{"to":93,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":91,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":93,"x":280,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Kweld Gelvdael, Scorpion's Stinger","descriptions":["The precarious steps come to an end at last, at the end of the scorpion's tail.  The swamp stretches out far below, the city of Riverhaven nestled beyond its wretched grasp far to the west."],"exits":[{"to":92,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":31,"exit":"none","move":"jump swamp"}],"color":"#A6A3D9","aliases":["Scorpion's Stinger","shrine"]},
  {"id":94,"x":240,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["A nearby tree lies half sunken into the marsh, severed from a trunk that has been splintered beyond recognition by some unknown act of nature -- or perhaps the unnatural forces that laid waste to this region."],"exits":[{"to":95,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":75,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":95,"x":240,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["Tendrils of brackish mist sweep errantly through the area, carried upon wretched zephyrs tainted by the noxious fumes drifting up from the swamp.  It's a wonder that any life can exist here, and that which does seems fouled beyond all hope of salvation."],"exits":[{"to":94,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"},{"to":96,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":96,"x":220,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["A single violet flower blooms from a creeper vine draped between the wretched, clawlike trees above, a faint semblance of unperverted life amidst a garden of death and gloom."],"exits":[{"to":107,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":97,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":95,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"},{"to":99,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":97,"x":240,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["Thick, tangled vines with a dusky green tint clutch and strangle a lone berry bush, as if trying to slowly wring the life from it and draw it under the swamp to add to the collective decay of this region."],"exits":[{"to":106,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":98,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":96,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":98,"x":260,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["To the northeast, a massive stone structure rises from the murky depths of the Zaulfung.  Even to the untrained eye it is more than apparent that this was a primitive temple of sorts, a gathering place of those who lived in this region before it was wracked with whatever blight corrupted it so."],"exits":[{"to":76,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":97,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"},{"to":106,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":99,"x":200,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["Brackish water rises roughly knee-high on a Human throughout this swamp, making it quite laborious to trudge through the slime.  It is unknown what lurks beneath its depths due to the sickly greenish-brown color the mud has taken on."],"exits":[{"to":96,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":100,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":100,"x":160,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["A Gor'Tog-sized bubble of brownish-green expands and contracts in the middle of the swamp here, breathing with a life of its own.  Vicious claws loom from the trees overhead, shielding the enigmatic bubble from the elements and incubating the foul stew."],"exits":[{"to":101,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":99,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":101,"x":180,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["The bleak surroundings grow even more dismal, viewing the expanse of murky swamp laid out in all directions.  Twisted marsh-dwelling trees reach up like primitive claws, vying for respite in the clean air that exists far above the noxious gasses burbling up from the watery slime underfoot."],"exits":[{"to":100,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"},{"to":102,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":102,"x":160,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["Murky slime burbles below, seeming to grow deeper and thicker the more one stands still.  Wild foliage climbs in every direction, the wicked and unintended children of the Zaulfung's inadvertent nourishment."],"exits":[{"to":8,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":103,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":101,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":103,"x":200,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["Tendrils of brackish mist sweep errantly through the area, carried upon wretched zephyrs tainted by the noxious fumes drifting up from the swamp.  It's a wonder that any life can exist here, and that which does seems fouled beyond all hope of salvation."],"exits":[{"to":104,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"},{"to":102,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":104,"x":220,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["A single violet flower blooms from a creeper vine draped between the wretched, clawlike trees above, a faint semblance of unperverted life amidst a garden of death and gloom."],"exits":[{"to":105,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":103,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"},{"to":110,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":105,"x":240,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["A dense shawl of thorny brush all but completely covers a stone wall that looms to the east.  The brush grows even thicker to the north, diverting the path westward.  Underfoot, the squishy slurp of the swamp is ever-present, unyielding despite the thickness of the foliage here."],"exits":[{"to":106,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"},{"to":104,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"},{"to":112,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":106,"x":240,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["Creeping foliage has laid claim to the bizarre structure that skirts the eastern side of this murky path, draping it in a shroud of thorny brambles and withered vines.  Further to the south, a large stone paw stretches out, curving southeast toward the front of the structure."],"exits":[{"to":105,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":98,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":97,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"},{"to":107,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":107,"x":220,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["A Gor'Tog-sized bubble of brownish-green expands and contracts in the middle of the swamp here, breathing with a life of its own.  Vicious claws loom from the trees overhead, shielding the enigmatic bubble from the elements and incubating the foul stew."],"exits":[{"to":106,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":96,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"},{"to":108,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":108,"x":200,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["The bleak surroundings grow even more dismal, viewing the expanse of murky swamp laid out in all directions.  Twisted marsh-dwelling trees reach up like primitive claws, vying for respite in the clean air that exists far above the noxious gasses burbling up from the watery slime underfoot."],"exits":[{"to":109,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":107,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":109,"x":200,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Ruined Shrine","descriptions":["Shattered and broken, a large wooden altar lies desecrated and befouled here, partially sunken into the thick mud.  Deep gouges and claw scratches mar the surface of the sacrilegious monument, likely torn asunder by the wicked hand of a sluagh."],"exits":[{"to":108,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"},{"to":117,"exit":"none","move":"touch alt;-pray"}],"aliases":["ruined shrine","wooden altar","sacrilegious monument"]},
  {"id":110,"x":200,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["Brackish water rises roughly knee-high on a Human throughout this swamp, making it quite laborious to trudge through the slime.  It is unknown what lurks beneath its depths due to the sickly greenish-brown color the mud has taken on."],"exits":[{"to":104,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":7,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":111,"x":200,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["A looming blanket of black fog drifts lazily through the air, obscuring the sky and incubating the swamp's noxious gasses in the cramped space beneath the canopy of twisted trees above."],"exits":[{"to":115,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":112,"exit":"east","move":"swim east"},{"to":7,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":112,"x":220,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["A raised portion of muddy soil to the east forks the path here.  Beyond the squishy mound, a wall of solid stone is visible, rising up into a primitive, almost animalistic form.  Thick tangles of shrubbery cling to its side, leaving very little to discern about its origin from this vantage."],"exits":[{"to":113,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":105,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":111,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":113,"x":240,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["A narrow passage exists here, sandwiched between a great stone wall to the east and a tangled mass of thorny brambles to the west.  Working through the strange tunnel is difficult, the vapors rising from the muddy waters below threatening to overcome even the most hardy of Dwarven noses."],"exits":[{"to":114,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":112,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":114,"x":240,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["Clouds of gnats flitter about with erratic purpose, inadvertently ending up in hair, nostrils, and open mouths.  Decaying foliage stagnates, half submerged in the stinking mire underfoot, and the likely attraction for the unwelcome swarm of pests.  It is all one can think of to get away from this place, or end up with a meal's worth of gnats rumbling about in their belly."],"exits":[{"to":116,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":113,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"},{"to":115,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":115,"x":200,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["Putrid fumes rising from the swamp coalesce into a heavy blanket of black fog that flows all through the surrounding air, held in by the ceiling of twisted branches and vines above."],"exits":[{"to":15,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":114,"exit":"northeast","move":"swim northeast"},{"to":111,"exit":"south","move":"swim south"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":116,"x":260,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["The structure to the east tapers, its surface curving smoothly to the northeast.  The stylized form of a hind leg is visible directly north, chiseled into the wall with some manner of primitive instruments that is far surpassed by more modern architectural feats."],"exits":[{"to":30,"exit":"north","move":"swim north"},{"to":114,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"},{"to":22,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
  {"id":117,"x":180,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Underwater","descriptions":["The murky waters end amongst a thick layer of decomposing sludge, heaped atop the uneven earth below.  Shadows rule here, allowing only a pale glimpse of the surroundings."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":0,"exit":"up","move":"up","hidden":true}],"linksTo":"Map31b_Maelshyve's_Fortress.xml"},
  {"id":118,"x":20,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Swamp","descriptions":[],"exits":[{"to":119,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":120,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":0,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":0,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":0,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":0,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":121,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":122,"exit":"go","move":"go curving path"}]},
  {"id":119,"x":40,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Swamp","descriptions":[],"exits":[{"to":120,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":121,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":118,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":0,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":0,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":0,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":0,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":120,"x":20,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Swamp","descriptions":[],"exits":[{"to":118,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":119,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":121,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":0,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":0,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":0,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":0,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":0,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":121,"x":40,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Swamp","descriptions":[],"exits":[{"to":120,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":119,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":118,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1,"exit":"climb","move":"climb sickly tree"},{"to":0,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":0,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":0,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":0,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":122,"x":0,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Zaulfung, Dense Swamp","descriptions":["Mud, your constant companion, squelches in your boots, is caked on your clothing and matted in your hair.  The only escape from it is to wash it off with fetid pond water, an unpalatable prospect.  The mud continues to the north but seems less pervasive to the northwest, while the southwest route is flooded but passable."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":0,"exit":"southwest","move":"swim southwest"},{"to":0,"exit":"northwest","move":"swim northwest"}],"linksTo":"Map31_Riverhaven_East_Gate.xml"},
  {"id":123,"x":260,"y":250,"z":0,"title":"Beneath The Zaulfung, Charred Caverns","descriptions":["Dark basalt walls flecked with unidentifiable minerals glisten in the damp atmosphere.  Sharp rocks underfoot are slick with slimy lichen, slowing travel through this treacherous area."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":0,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":89,"exit":"go","move":"go amorphous spirits"}],"aliases":["Cleric Passage"],"linksTo":"Map31b_Maelshyve's_Fortress.xml"}
 ],
 "labels": [
  {"text":"(shifting maze)","x":0,"y":260,"z":0},
  {"text":"Zaulfung","x":10,"y":250,"z":0},
